WEBVTT

00:02:29.836 --> 00:02:31.036
Awesome.

00:02:31.036 --> 00:02:33.116
How do I defeat coronavirus?

00:02:33.116 --> 00:02:37.876
A 41-year-old, middle-aged,
slightly overweight male with flat foot.

00:02:38.596 --> 00:02:41.676
It's easy to feel helpless,

00:02:41.716 --> 00:02:43.396
out of control, adrift.

00:02:43.916 --> 00:02:45.836
But at the end of the day,

00:02:45.876 --> 00:02:49.796
try letting go of what you can't control

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:52.796
and just focus on what you can control.

00:02:53.196 --> 00:02:54.396
The simple stuff.

00:02:54.836 --> 00:02:55.996
Wear a mask.

00:02:56.356 --> 00:02:57.556
Get vaccinated.

00:02:57.876 --> 00:03:00.156
Take care of your daily chores.